        "organizations:LeaveOrganization": "AWS lists it because accepting an invitation can move an account out of its current organization; not granted to a runtime."
      },
      "unscoped": "Narrowed to AWS's ARN formats (arn:${Partition}:organizations::${Account}:handshake/o-*/*/h-*), the call was denied live in the Organizations Bindings suite; the grant stays on *."
    },
    "CancelHandshake": {
